    "note": "提交完只剩两条未跟踪的（把 a.txt 提交掉不等于把别人也提交掉），状态那句要带上新的 commit 号"
  },
  {
    "eval": "fetch('/api/gitstatus?sid='+encodeURIComponent(curId)).then(r=>r.json()).then(d=>JSON.stringify({branch:d.branch,last:d.last,clean:d.clean,count:d.count,staged:d.stagedCount,entries:d.entries.map(e=>e.p+(e.staged?'*':'')),stillDirty:d.clean===false,countTwo:d.count==2,noStaged:d.stagedCount==0}))",
    "must": [
      "branch",
      "stillDirty",
      "countTwo",
      "noStaged"
    ],
    "note": "界面说的数要和 `git status` 自己说的一致（提交后干净项该归 0、剩余该是 2）——只看界面会把\"面板自己算错\"当成\"git 就是这样\""
  },
  {
    "shot": "g03-committed"
  },
  {
    "eval": "(()=>{document.querySelector('#gitMsg').value='';document.querySelector('#gCommit').click();return '空说明按下去了'})()"
  },
  {
    "sleep": 1200
  },
  {
    "eval": "(()=>{const s=document.querySelector('#gitState').textContent;return {state:s,refused:s.indexOf('提交说明')>=0||s.indexOf('没有可提交')>=0}})()",
